4. Delete Student
5. View All Students
6. Exit
```

---

## 💾 Data Storage Format

Student records are stored in a text file using comma-separated values:

```text
ID, Name, Age, Course
```

Example:

```text
101, John Doe,20, Computer Science
102, Sarah Khan,19, Information Technology
103, Rahul Sharma,21, Electronics
```

